    },
    {
      "snapshot_id": "dfdc0816797bf578d0363591",
      "chunk_id": "2c17cd478114bcc2f247ba44",
      "path": "README.md",
      "start_line": 56,
      "end_line": 80,
      "content_hash": "3f1bb8c64b85e0b493927dd833dfb11b86d875801528d10390258067b5617eb3",
      "content": "## Usage\n\n```js\nimport mitt from 'mitt'\n\nconst emitter = mitt()\n\n// listen to an event\nemitter.on('foo', e => console.log('foo', e) )\n\n// listen to all events\nemitter.on('*', (type, e) => console.log(type, e) )\n\n// fire an event\nemitter.emit('foo', { a: 'b' })\n\n// clearing all events\nemitter.all.clear()\n\n// working with handler references:\nfunction onFoo() {}\nemitter.on('foo', onFoo)   // listen\nemitter.off('foo', onFoo)  // unlisten\n```\n",
      "symbol": "Mitt / Usage",
      "truncated": false
    },
